                <mxCell id="H0t42ktDHQOEmPQqYsWt-24" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Classification Decession Flow&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;; font-size: 14px; line-height: 20px;&quot;&gt;The complaint classification is based on the PTC/non-PTC assignment. Because adverse events are critical, the AE check remains an explicit step in the decision tree to avoid misclassifying AE complaints as non-PTCs.&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
